{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/d26214cbe3b6da92ad7a111edb7588cd.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=175 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure solo, or with 4 friends locally, in this game of fate, fortune, and dice! In Die by Die, you step into a living, text-driven adventure built from a rich library of hand-crafted story fragments. The dice of fate decide the setting and plot points for each run, but your actions and your dice rolls will tell the story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/043b56cfed1d8397270b64c9fec0f6df.poster.avif?t=1765314036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/043b56cfed1d8397270b64c9fec0f6df.webm?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/043b56cfed1d8397270b64c9fec0f6df.mp4?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sneak past guards, strike up conversations, solve environmental puzzles, buy supplies, or pick a fight; the choice is yours. Creative thinking opens new paths, but risky moves may call for a roll of the dice and your character\u2019s stats to decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/f41201980a3abd37765999ee72139f2b.poster.avif?t=1765314036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/f41201980a3abd37765999ee72139f2b.webm?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/f41201980a3abd37765999ee72139f2b.mp4?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combat is tense and turn-based. Dialogue can sway allies or foes. Exploration reveals secrets and surprises. Every decision shapes a one-of-a-kind story that plays differently each time you venture into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/e34bb12224a57e89c2ecfdd44731de53.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as a <i>Warrior</i>, <i>Cleric, Spell-Sword, Hunter, Vagabond</i>, or <i>Sorcerer</i>. Each class has unique abilities to help you adventure, fight and survive. Choose carefully when playing as a group, maximising class synergies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/defada529f06054a10e05b6a950452e9.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Die By Die draws inspiration from many classic and new table top rpg to create a new dice system that is intuitive and rewarding. Each player has a set of six, six sided dice of varying types (Attack, Defense, Might, Mind, Finesse and general). Using the correct dice type for an ability check or combat manoeuvre provides a dice bonus. Ability checks, conversations, and combat all draw from the same dice pool. Combat is all about managing your dice well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/7398af355149dcf408b99df7977b3388.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect new dice, buy special items, and level up your adventurer to improve your chances of survival and success in the ever changing dungeons that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/11735193caf62efe120e524bfa684cc7.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose between semi, or completely randomised adventures, then at the beginning of a session the game will roll to create the setting, plot points and encounters and goal of the story. As you complete more stories and encounters, your options for creating custom adventure will grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965330?t=1765314036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/9fc96a34b06921e9258ab13740d5317dc6195b6d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765314036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/6ce33cac9b4a80df4d43c4ad372614f7340205ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765314036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/6ce33cac9b4a80df4d43c4ad372614f7340205ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765314036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/d26214cbe3b6da92ad7a111edb7588cd.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=175 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure solo, or with 4 friends locally, in this game of fate, fortune, and dice! In Die by Die, you step into a living, text-driven adventure built from a rich library of hand-crafted story fragments. The dice of fate decide the setting and plot points for each run, but your actions and your dice rolls will tell the story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/043b56cfed1d8397270b64c9fec0f6df.poster.avif?t=1765314036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/043b56cfed1d8397270b64c9fec0f6df.webm?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/043b56cfed1d8397270b64c9fec0f6df.mp4?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sneak past guards, strike up conversations, solve environmental puzzles, buy supplies, or pick a fight; the choice is yours. Creative thinking opens new paths, but risky moves may call for a roll of the dice and your character\u2019s stats to decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/f41201980a3abd37765999ee72139f2b.poster.avif?t=1765314036\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/f41201980a3abd37765999ee72139f2b.webm?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/f41201980a3abd37765999ee72139f2b.mp4?t=1765314036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combat is tense and turn-based. Dialogue can sway allies or foes. Exploration reveals secrets and surprises. Every decision shapes a one-of-a-kind story that plays differently each time you venture into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/e34bb12224a57e89c2ecfdd44731de53.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as a <i>Warrior</i>, <i>Cleric, Spell-Sword, Hunter, Vagabond</i>, or <i>Sorcerer</i>. Each class has unique abilities to help you adventure, fight and survive. Choose carefully when playing as a group, maximising class synergies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/defada529f06054a10e05b6a950452e9.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Die By Die draws inspiration from many classic and new table top rpg to create a new dice system that is intuitive and rewarding. Each player has a set of six, six sided dice of varying types (Attack, Defense, Might, Mind, Finesse and general). Using the correct dice type for an ability check or combat manoeuvre provides a dice bonus. Ability checks, conversations, and combat all draw from the same dice pool. Combat is all about managing your dice well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/7398af355149dcf408b99df7977b3388.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=247 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect new dice, buy special items, and level up your adventurer to improve your chances of survival and success in the ever changing dungeons that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/11735193caf62efe120e524bfa684cc7.avif?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose between semi, or completely randomised adventures, then at the beginning of a session the game will roll to create the setting, plot points and encounters and goal of the story. As you complete more stories and encounters, your options for creating custom adventure will grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/extras/555424b6c745480666af3e2a4183118d.webp?t=1765314036\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p>","developers":["Hudol House"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965330/cf62ac50b3e6f4201e532af9b18e753480bbd04d/header.jpg?t=1765314036","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or above (Apple silicon-based processors) or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965330/1157794453/e040b2ae47a2ac4e7e6ae0fd26f1c69e3e4c51bd/1765260104/dash_av1.mpd?t=176531